  "Description": {
    "Cost": 701601,
    "UIName": "Javelin",
    "Id": "chassisdef_javelin_JVN-HT",
    "Name": "Javelin",
    "Details": "The 'Hi There!' is the personal 'Mech of Fourth Deneb Light Cavalry's MechWarrior Bill 'Wildman' Wilkes. Mounting a 180-rated XL engine and built on an Endo-Steel chassis, the 'Hi There!' retains the 10N's classic torso SRM-6s and uses the extra weight savings to mount a pair of medium lasers in each arm. Aside from swapping the 10 single heat sinks for double strength versions, the Hi There! features the same level of SRM reloads, armor coverage, and jump jet capacity as the 10N.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.01</color></b>",
